fainting, giving monsters an open chance to bash on you. Although the other day
I think I found a bug. I was starving (couldn't find any food and my god wasn't
happy with me for some reason) and I kept fainting, but all of a sudden my
status said I was fainted, yet I was still walking around, and did this
for several hundred turns, until finally a jaguar killed me (I was too hungry
to cast any spells, particularly healing :(
